Data Sources & Third-Party Licences:
------------------------------------

1. Administrative Boundaries, Codes, and Names
   Transcribed from official legislative texts and executive decrees published in
   the Official Gazette of the People's Democratic Republic of Algeria (Journal
   officiel de la République algérienne démocratique et populaire), with foundational
   transcription referenced from djazairdev/wilayas.

2. Postal Codes and Coordinates Compilation (GeoAlgeria)
   Commune postal codes and municipality geographic coordinates are derived from
   the GeoAlgeria project (https://github.com/yasserstudio/geoalgeria).

   Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Yasser's studio (https://yasser.studio)

