3. OpenStreetMap-Derived Coordinates (ODbL 1.0)
   323 of the 1,541 commune center coordinates were derived from OpenStreetMap
   administrative relations (admin_level=8) via GeoAlgeria and are made available
   under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0:
   © OpenStreetMap contributors.

   These coordinates are subject to the ODbL and are NOT released under CC0.
   Any redistributed derived database incorporating these coordinates must comply
   with the ODbL share-alike and attribution requirements.

   For terms, see:
   - https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
   - https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

4. Wilaya Vector Maps and Geometries (SVG and GeoJSON)
   The 69-wilaya administrative boundary geometries, SVG vector paths, and
   GeoJSON features are derived from OpenStreetMap administrative relations
   (Web Mercator projection) via the Algeria69WilayaMap project
   (https://github.com/chemsallioua/Algeria69WilayaMap).

